      "Keep the pool near half adjective bins and half adverb bins.",
      "Wrong-bin taps are the only distractor. Never add extra choice words.",
      "For tier 3 use adjectives after looks or feels, or -ly adverbs after an action verb that sits near a noun."
    ]
